    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now osteoarthritis of the knees is my leading thought, not anything worse. An X-ray of both knees is what I'd like next, for knee pain. I'm going to put you on paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day, for two weeks. That's for knee pain.",
